Read the declared R5 metadata subset

Usage: imageinfo metadata read [OPTIONS] [INPUT]...

Arguments:
  [INPUT]...  Literal input paths; use -- before paths named help or starting with -

Options:
      --help
          Show help for this command
      --version
          Show version after validating arguments
      --output <output>
          Result format (help always uses plain text) [possible values: text, json]
      --color <color>
          Presentation preference; foundation output is plain text [possible values: auto, always, never]
      --no-interactive
          Keep this invocation noninteractive
      --interactive
          Request guided mode (not implemented yet)
      --max-bytes <max-bytes>
          Metadata read byte budget (default 8388608)
      --max-preview-bytes <max-preview-bytes>
          Maximum one-preview size (default 67108864)
      --tag <tag>
          Select a tag; repeat to select several
      --values <values>
          Select the metadata value view [possible values: raw, normalized, display, all]

Coverage is partial and explicit. Source bytes are never modified; --tag selects every matching implemented occurrence.
